		"Get a netherite Rapier, Lute, Lyre or Harp Crossbow."
		""
		"&6Craft&r: at a smithing table, the diamond piece + a netherite ingot + a netherite upgrade template (Smith (rapier), Enchanter (lute, lyre) or Hunter (harp crossbow) level 20)."
