	"quest.2822EF3B2E746D80.title": "A Diamond Edge"
	"quest.284B33294DEB1EE1.quest_desc": [
		"Armor has no sockets of its own. A &6Socket Mount&r adds one: put the armor and the mount in an &6anvil&r. Each piece takes one."
		"Then put the armor and a cut gem in the anvil to set the gem. A full set holds four. The Jeweler's Kit can take a gem back out."
		"Socket Mounts are crafted by a Jeweler of level 15."
	]
	"quest.284B33294DEB1EE1.quest_subtitle": "Sockets for armor"
	"quest.284B33294DEB1EE1.title": "Set in Gold"
	"quest.2862FA76D20232FE.quest_desc": [
		"Get a diamond Holy Wand or Staff."
		""
		"&6Craft&r: Enchanter level 10, or any friend who is one."
		"&6Buy&r: the Monk in the Sanctuary may have it in stock."
		"&6Loot&r: Wildlands and Frontier dungeons, and the Ancient Remnant, Maledictus, the Leviathan and Scylla."
