	"quest.2862FA76D20232FE.title": "A Diamond Edge"
	"quest.2912F0282CC64827.quest_desc": [
		"Get an Elemental Staff."
		""
		"&6Craft&r: anyone can, at a crafting table."
		"&6Loot&r: Hearthlands chests, small dungeons and the Amethyst Crab."
	]
	"quest.2912F0282CC64827.quest_subtitle": "Tier 1 weapon"
	"quest.2912F0282CC64827.title": "First Steel"
	"quest.2934A45F0ED4C1D4.quest_desc": [
		"An &9Explorer&r (J) draws &6Survey Maps&r: use one and it becomes a map to the nearest place of its kind."
		"- Settlement (map + emerald): anyone can draw it. Villages and taverns."
		"- Crypt (Explorer 10), Great Dungeon (Explorer 20), Boss Lair (Explorer 30)."
		"Copy the finished map at a &6cartography table&r so everyone in the party has one."
		"Explorers also craft the travel network: scrolls, Sharestones (every stone of one color links to the others), Waystones and Warp Plates."
	]
	"quest.2934A45F0ED4C1D4.quest_subtitle": "Explorer"
	"quest.2934A45F0ED4C1D4.title": "Charting the Unknown"
	"quest.29920E4F607C2A96.quest_desc": [
		"Every Wind Mage walks the same road: a weapon, then a full set of armor, each tier stronger than the last."
		"This row follows it from your first steel to the armor of legends."
		""
		"Each step can be &ocrafted&r, &obought&r or &olooted&r, and says how. Gear you already own counts as soon as the step opens."
	]
	"quest.29920E4F607C2A96.quest_subtitle": "Your class, step by step"
	"quest.29920E4F607C2A96.title": "The Wind Mage's Path"
	"quest.29E79544ED9ADE2F.quest_desc": [
		"Throw an eye and follow it underground to the stronghold and its portal room."
	]
	"quest.29E79544ED9ADE2F.title": "The Stronghold"
	"quest.2A77503D5F21B68C.quest_desc": [
		"Get a Wizard Staff."
		""
		"&6Craft&r: anyone can, at a crafting table."
		"&6Buy&r: the Wizard Merchant in the Wizard Tower may have it in stock."
