	"quest.2C247588B7ACFE43.title": "The Bard's Path"
	"quest.2C9281C642E70027.quest_desc": [
		"The &aHearthlands&r are the gentle lands: plains, forests, meadows and rivers, with villages, taverns and small dungeons. Learn your class here."
		"Walk the streets of a village to begin."
		""
		"&7Reward: a map marking the nearest small dungeon.&r"
	]
	"quest.2C9281C642E70027.quest_subtitle": "Hearthlands"
	"quest.2C9281C642E70027.title": "The Hearth Road"
	"quest.2D964BD77219E2CA.quest_desc": [
		"With other players online, a killing blow leaves you &cdowned&r instead. You have 60 seconds."
		"A friend holds use (right-click) on you for 3 seconds to pick you up. Heal spells cannot reach the downed: someone has to come to you."
		"You get up with 3 hearts and a short Weakness. Fall again soon and the same timer keeps running."
		"Alone on the server, nobody is coming: you simply die. Lava and the void kill at once."
		"A real death costs you nothing: your things and experience wait in a &6grave&r where you fell. Chat tells you where."
	]
	"quest.2D964BD77219E2CA.quest_subtitle": "Downed and revived"
	"quest.2D964BD77219E2CA.title": "Pick Them Up"
	"quest.2E75B2448D173567.quest_desc": [
		"Fill the frame and jump in. There is no coming back until the dragon falls, or you die."
	]
	"quest.2E75B2448D173567.title": "Into the End"
	"quest.2ED6CFFFB9CFB608.quest_desc": [
		"Wear or carry all four pieces of the &eWizard Robes&r: helmet, chest, legs and boots."
		""
		"&6Craft&r: anyone can, at a crafting table."
		"&6Buy&r: the Wizard Merchant in the Wizard Tower may have it in stock."
		"&6Loot&r: Hearthlands chests, small dungeons and the Amethyst Crab."
	]
	"quest.2ED6CFFFB9CFB608.quest_subtitle": "Tier 1 armor"
	"quest.2ED6CFFFB9CFB608.title": "Wizard Robes"
	"quest.301A632C8984BC41.quest_desc": [
		"Get a Composite Longbow or an iron Spear."
		""
		"&6Craft&r: anyone can, at a crafting table."
		"&6Buy&r: the Archery Artisan in the Archery Range may have it in stock."
		"&6Loot&r: Hearthlands chests, small dungeons and the Amethyst Crab."
	]
	"quest.301A632C8984BC41.quest_subtitle": "Tier 1 weapon"
	"quest.301A632C8984BC41.title": "First Steel"
	"quest.303494E14ED1C03B.quest_desc": [
		"Choose who you start as. You get the class tome, a starter weapon, one armor piece, and the runes or arrows it burns."
		""
		"Nothing is final: a second class waits at any Spell Binding Table."
		""
		"Your class's road from here, weapon by weapon and set by set, opens in the &6Your Calling&r tab."
	]
	"quest.303494E14ED1C03B.quest_subtitle": "Your class starter kit"
	"quest.303494E14ED1C03B.title": "Choose Your Calling"
	"quest.30AD317EAFFF4326.quest_desc": [
		"A &6Library&r stores enchanted books as points and hands out any enchantment you have stored, at any level up to the best you put in. The &6Ender Library&r holds far more."
		"Feed it the books you will never use."
	]
	"quest.30AD317EAFFF4326.quest_subtitle": "Store enchantments"
	"quest.30AD317EAFFF4326.title": "The Library"
	"quest.311B8E5CCB0CEAB9.quest_desc": [
		"Dark brick bridges cross the lava seas. Find a fortress."
	]
	"quest.311B8E5CCB0CEAB9.title": "Fortress of Flame"
	"quest.318F3444CB533462.quest_desc": [
		"Rings and necklaces go in their own slots (G opens them) and add spell power, health or speed."
		"Copper and iron rings anyone can craft. Gem and gold jewelry takes a Jeweler of level 10; or buy one, or find one in a dungeon."
	]
	"quest.318F3444CB533462.quest_subtitle": "Ring slot"
	"quest.318F3444CB533462.title": "A Ring for Each Hand"
	"quest.31E240F857E39A16.quest_desc": [
		"Two endgame sets answer a Warrior. Either one completes this step:"
		"- &dDestroyer Armor&r: Berserker Armor piece + &dChampion's Lost Crystal&r"
		"- &dOnslaught Armor&r: Berserker Armor piece + &dChampion's Forgotten Crystal&r"
		"Upgrade each piece at a smithing table (diamond or netherite pieces both work)."
		""
		"Every upgrade also takes an &dArmory template&r, copied at a crafting table with diamonds."
		"Crystals and templates drop from &cIgnis&r, the &5Ender Guardian&r, the &5Ender Dragon&r and the &8Wither&r."
		"Only a Smith of level 25 can do the upgrade; anyone can wear it."
	]
	"quest.31E240F857E39A16.quest_subtitle": "Endgame armor"
	"quest.31E240F857E39A16.title": "The Armory"
	"quest.31E9814687B5A8AE.quest_desc": [
		"Giant tracks lead to a cave in the snowy plains. &bSkor, the Yeti&r does not take kindly to visitors."
		"Optional. Everyone nearby at the kill earns a Hoarfrost Pelt."
	]
	"quest.31E9814687B5A8AE.quest_subtitle": "Optional boss"
	"quest.31E9814687B5A8AE.title": "Tracks in the Snow"
	"quest.320B32FBD74A9EAF.quest_desc": [
		"You can walk anywhere. Two doors need keys:"
		"- &6Nether Sigil&r: from The Harbinger, at the end of the Overworld chapter. Fire will not wake a Nether portal; the sigil will."
		"- &dVoid Shard&r: from Ignis, at the end of the Nether chapter. No Eye of Ender without one."
		"Everyone near a boss when it falls gets their own key."
	]
	"quest.320B32FBD74A9EAF.quest_subtitle": "The Nether Sigil and the Void Shard"
	"quest.320B32FBD74A9EAF.title": "Locked Doors"
	"quest.32C34EE2A68B3253.quest_desc": [
		"Get a Royal Longbow or Mechanic Shortbow."
		""
		"&6Craft&r: Hunter level 10, or any friend who is one."
		"&6Buy&r: the Archery Artisan in the Archery Range may have it in stock."
		"&6Loot&r: Wildlands and Frontier dungeons, and the Ancient Remnant, Maledictus, the Leviathan and Scylla."
	]
	"quest.32C34EE2A68B3253.quest_subtitle": "Tier 2 weapon"
	"quest.32C34EE2A68B3253.title": "A Diamond Edge"
	"quest.341E7D13B080731C.quest_desc": [
		"No smith makes these. The &5Ender Guardian&r, the &5Ender Dragon&r and the &8Wither&r carry one-of-a-kind weapons; one of them may be a staff made for you."
		"Bring friends: these are the hardest fights in the world."
	]
	"quest.341E7D13B080731C.quest_subtitle": "Optional: boss-only weapon"
	"quest.341E7D13B080731C.title": "A Legend in Hand"
	"quest.3432529E4CA45247.quest_desc": [
		"Get a netherite Holy Wand or Staff."
		""
		"&6Craft&r: at a smithing table, the diamond piece + a netherite ingot + a netherite upgrade template (Enchanter level 20)."
