	"quest.42C7A3AB42E6134D.title": "Dragon-Slaying Enchanter"
	"quest.4366581CB1238872.quest_desc": [
		"The endgame set of every War Archer: the &dSentinel Archer Armor&r."
		"At a smithing table, upgrade each Bowman Armor piece (diamond or netherite) with a &dGeneral's Lost Crystal&r."
		""
		"Every upgrade also takes an &dArmory template&r, copied at a crafting table with diamonds."
		"Crystals and templates drop from &cIgnis&r, the &5Ender Guardian&r, the &5Ender Dragon&r and the &8Wither&r."
		"Only a Hunter of level 25 can do the upgrade; anyone can wear it."
	]
