	"quest.498B6C57012F8D8C.quest_desc": [
		"You start in a plains village. Besides its gazebo, villages can have buildings for the classes, each with its own merchant:"
		"- &dWizard Tower&r: Wizard Merchant (wizards and mages)"
		"- &eSanctuary&r: Monk (paladins and priests)"
		"- &cBarracks&r: Arms Dealer (rogues and warriors)"
		"- &aArchery Range&r: Archery Artisan (archers)"
		"- &6Pub&r: Luthier (bards)"
		"A Jeweler sells rings and necklaces. Not every village has every building: if yours lacks one, the next village may have it."
		"Berserkers and forcemasters have no building of their own; the Arms Dealer and Jeweler serve everyone."
		""
		"Trade once with any of these merchants. Use the emeralds from your calling."
	]
	"quest.498B6C57012F8D8C.quest_subtitle": "Visit the village"
	"quest.498B6C57012F8D8C.title": "Merchants of Every Calling"
	"quest.49CA855A6EB004C9.quest_desc": [
		"Enchanting here has three stats, shown on the table: &aEterna&r (how high the level goes), &cQuanta&r (how wild the result) and &dArcana&r (how many and how rare the enchantments)."
		"Every shelf around the table adds to them. Plain bookshelves reach level 30; the shelves below go further."
	]
	"quest.49CA855A6EB004C9.quest_subtitle": "How the enchanting table works"
	"quest.49CA855A6EB004C9.title": "Beyond Level 30"
	"quest.4A0B61034D97339F.quest_desc": [
		"Wear or carry all four pieces of the &eNetherite Deadeye Armor&r: helmet, chest, legs and boots."
		""
		"&6Craft&r: at a smithing table, the diamond piece + a netherite ingot + a netherite upgrade template (Hunter level 20)."
		"&6Loot&r: the Harbinger and the Netherite Monstrosity."
	]
	"quest.4A0B61034D97339F.quest_subtitle": "Tier 3 armor"
	"quest.4A0B61034D97339F.title": "Netherite Deadeye Armor"
