	"quest.647FF63D4206EF38.quest_desc": [
		"Two endgame sets answer a Paladin. Either one completes this step:"
		"- &dJusticar Armor&r: Crusader Armor piece + &dRedeemer's Lost Crystal&r"
		"- &dLightbringer Armor&r: Crusader Armor piece + &dRedeemer's Forgotten Crystal&r"
		"Upgrade each piece at a smithing table (diamond or netherite pieces both work)."
		""
